<title>POLAND: Centrostal surges 55 pct on bourse debut.</title>
<headline>Centrostal surges 55 pct on bourse debut.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish steel products maker Centrostal SA started trade on the parallel market of the Warsaw bourse on Wednesday at 6.5 zlotys, 54.8 percent higher than its issue price.</p>
<p>Centrostal's January initial public offering of one million shares at 4.2 zlotys each was oversubscribed.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
